#: b73e002c400d4cf79cd239a3877c050f
msgid "o3.Irreps"
msgstr "o3.Irreps"

#: af8abbf9e1454cb896732a6cc492519f
msgid "输出特征的第一个维度（行）的不可约表示。"
msgstr "Irreducible representation of the first dimension (rows) of the output features."

#: 45c74c7ccb7f41f49c8294fa01fe04d5
msgid "输出特征的第二个维度（列）的不可约表示。"
msgstr "Irreducible representation of the second dimension (columns) of the output features."

#: 5485b0ae94734d2b889ba90df621d120
msgid ""
"控制权重生成方式。如果为 `True`，权重是模块内部 固定的 `nn.Parameter`；如果为 `False`，权重由一个 "
"`o3.Linear` 层从 输入特征动态生成。"
msgstr ""
"Controls how weights are generated. If `True`, the weights are fixed `nn.Parameter`s within the module; "
"if `False`, the weights are dynamically generated from the input features by an `o3.Linear` layer."

#: ef1fe9936b0743168520fb29a70d9428
msgid "bool"
msgstr "bool"

#: 1c7e76d7759d4098a7b21778b350483c
